  "content": "\n\n<h1>ChicknTurtle 的 3D 工具</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ChicknTurtle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-ChicknTurtle-f16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=black&color=f16436\" alt=\"ChicknTurtle\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fChicknTurtle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ChicknTurtle-a?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=1bd96a\" alt=\"ChicknTurtle\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-3d-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1151910?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=black&color=f16436\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fchicknturtles-3d-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/8ZVNGHGD?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=1bd96a\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>⚔️ 簡潔的 3D 模型，適用於：<br>\n劍、斧頭、鎬子、鏟子、鋤頭、錘子與三叉戟  </p>\n<h2>資訊</h2>\n<p>只要不修改工具的模型，即可與其他材質包相容<br>\n目前不支援任何模組添加的工具<br>\n模型使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.blockbench.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockbench</a> 製作</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-3d-totems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8Gv9gm22/dcbdc1fc77706ed17f81436220214b3993d0734f_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-better-shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vlbXWQ2k/45845988021373eca428a6ef2b9edf4241fc8ba3_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/numbered-levels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4fU34F4v/02d76ca13a36c6ef976865b756839bc75862dd24_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>💚 記得追蹤我！</strong></p>",
